{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5d5b9360b4d43774","name":"Sabaoth Squadron","source":{"id":"source:reference-5d5b9360b4d43774","title":"Sabaoth Squadron","revision":23793,"timestamp":"2024-10-06T22:38:48Z","sha256":"9333fd6d4f7983ef6773c5171c14240f651e8d873e593fde98c820139e719d1e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23793","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sabaoth%20Squadron&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5d5b9360b4d43774","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The mercenary Sabaoth Squadron act under the guidance of Separatist leaders to deploy dangerous chemical weapons such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trihexalon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trihexalon","referenceId":"reference:10266ff7a5fa3d92"},". Sabaoth Squadron, and other blasters-for-hire from across the galaxy, find themselves in the Separatists' employ, performing tasks and clandestine operations that cannot be trusted to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". Moreover, in many parts of the galaxy, the Confederacy's war effort requires mercenaries simply to maintain the Separatists' military presence when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," troops are destroyed faster than they can be replenished.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In the years leading up to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", Sabaoth Squadron worked for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Count Dooku"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Count_Dooku","referenceId":"reference:28558e49506f1132"}," to strengthen Confederate defenses and combat the pirates who were harassing the Confederate worlds. Under the command of Captain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cavik Toth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cavik_Toth","referenceId":"reference:0444e8214739f4a5"},", Sabaoth Squadron fights for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}," in early engagements of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", influencing key battles.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sabaoth Squadron Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Cavik Toth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cavik_Toth","referenceId":"reference:0444e8214739f4a5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sabaoth Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sabaoth_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:62d2a6f10fdb7ec5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children"